        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite dice‑building creature collector where you control both sides of the fight by choosing one action at a time. Capture bugs, unlock new dice, and customize every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/6bd7fd2220a3549459104f8226041c38.webp?t=1777608787\" width=600 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/404446c811d1770aca547ddd8238c82f.poster.avif?t=1777608787\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/404446c811d1770aca547ddd8238c82f.webm?t=1777608787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/404446c811d1770aca547ddd8238c82f.mp4?t=1777608787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control both sides of the fight by choosing the order in which actions happen. Each die shows an action, and the battle only moves forward when you decide which ones to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/0f1655302dcdc3bd7ac615765d0da55b.webp?t=1777608787\" width=600 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/505f141cd6f5d28128db0ec5d7c0cb1f.poster.avif?t=1777608787\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/505f141cd6f5d28128db0ec5d7c0cb1f.webm?t=1777608787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/505f141cd6f5d28128db0ec5d7c0cb1f.mp4?t=1777608787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weaken and capture any bug instead of defeating it, then choose at the end of the battle to swap it into your party or send it home to your collection for future runs. Yes, even elites and bosses can be captured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/461afca8726c004ce671f8186195be60.webp?t=1777608787\" width=600 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/1dd55ee3a8a91b862fac03fe56793e5a.poster.avif?t=1777608787\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/1dd55ee3a8a91b862fac03fe56793e5a.webm?t=1777608787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/1dd55ee3a8a91b862fac03fe56793e5a.mp4?t=1777608787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your party from any bugs you have captured and customize your support die with the faces you have unlocked before starting each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/7c33106ca3c0465ddbe94005addd3823.webp?t=1777608787\" width=600 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/e4f55208fd05ba7fc2546532bf10ff8f.poster.avif?t=1777608787\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/e4f55208fd05ba7fc2546532bf10ff8f.webm?t=1777608787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/e4f55208fd05ba7fc2546532bf10ff8f.mp4?t=1777608787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create powerful synergies by choosing bugs whose abilities stack or complement each other. Their position in battle and the order in which the dice are played determine how their effects chain together into unique and sometimes broken combos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/f14bc67f95fba5cab53b51ad9ccbb361.webp?t=1777608787\" width=600 height=39 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/d6770bad8202535a5bd053a58f47307f.poster.avif?t=1777608787\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/d6770bad8202535a5bd053a58f47307f.webm?t=1777608787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/d6770bad8202535a5bd053a58f47307f.mp4?t=1777608787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the shop at any time to reroll or restock it with upgrades that support your build. Battles end with rewards that give either a permanent stat boost or more bottles to catch new bugs. Bosses drop new die faces that unlock new ways to customize your support die in future runs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURE HIGHLIGHTS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture every bug</strong>, including elites and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build unique teams</strong> from your growing collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your support die</strong> with unlocked faces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create powerful synergies</strong> through team choice and dice order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual PvP matches </strong>with no risk of losing units and full control of both sides.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viewer-triggered Twitch Redeems </strong>that help or sabotage your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully compatible on Steam Deck</strong>, with smooth performance and complete controller support.</p></li></ul>",
